values ('survival-04', 4, 1, '敢开口', '时间和约定', '约好明天见', '第 4 个课程日：约好明天见', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"在几点钟","pattern":"at + 时间","explanation":"具体几点前面用 at。","exampleEnglish":"Let''s meet at nine.","exampleChinese":"我们九点见。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"A","english":"Are you free tomorrow morning?","chinese":"你明天早上有空吗？"},{"speaker":"B","english":"Yes. Let''s meet at nine.","chinese":"有，我们九点见。"},{"speaker":"A","english":"Great. See you tomorrow.","chinese":"好的，明天见。"}]'::jsonb, '明早九点', 'Lin and Anna want to visit a museum. They choose tomorrow morning because the museum is quiet then. They meet at nine near the entrance. Lin writes the time in her phone and sets a small alarm.', '小林和安娜想参观博物馆。她们选择明天早上，因为那时比较安静。两人约在九点于入口附近见面。小林把时间记进手机并设置了闹钟。', 1)
