values ('survival-06', 6, 2, '吃饭点单', '咖啡店第一单', '咖啡店', '第 6 个课程日：咖啡店', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"礼貌点单","pattern":"名词 + please","explanation":"最紧张时不用长句，商品名称后加 please 就能完成点单。","exampleEnglish":"A hot tea, please.","exampleChinese":"请给我一杯热茶。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Hi! What can I get for you?","chinese":"你好！需要什么？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"An iced coffee, please.","chinese":"请给我一杯冰咖啡。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"For here or to go?","chinese":"堂食还是带走？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"For here, please.","chinese":"在这里喝。"}]'::jsonb, '第一杯冰咖啡', 'It is a warm morning. Lin walks into a small coffee shop and looks at the menu. She wants an iced coffee. The staff smiles, and Lin says her order clearly. A minute later, she holds a cold cup and feels proud.', '这是一个温暖的早晨。小林走进一家小咖啡店看菜单。她想要冰咖啡，店员微笑着听她清楚地点单。一分钟后，她拿着冰凉的杯子，觉得很有成就感。', 1)
