values ('survival-07', 7, 2, '吃饭点单', '早餐不要饿肚子', '早餐店', '第 7 个课程日：早餐店', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"表达想要","pattern":"Can I have + 食物?","explanation":"点餐时用 Can I have，既简单又自然。","exampleEnglish":"Can I have an egg and some milk?","exampleChinese":"我可以要一个鸡蛋和一些牛奶吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Staff","english":"What would you like?","chinese":"你想要什么？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Can I have a sandwich and some milk?","chinese":"我可以要一个三明治和一些牛奶吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Anything else?","chinese":"还要别的吗？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"That''s all, thank you.","chinese":"就这些，谢谢。"}]'::jsonb, '五分钟早餐', 'Lin has an early train, so she needs a quick breakfast. She buys a sandwich, an egg, and some milk. She puts the banana in her bag for later. The breakfast is simple, but it gives her energy for the morning.', '小林要赶早班火车，所以需要一份快速早餐。她买了三明治、鸡蛋和牛奶，把香蕉放进包里留着晚点吃。早餐很简单，却给了她一上午的能量。', 1)
