values ('survival-08', 8, 2, '吃饭点单', '看懂一张菜单', '餐厅点餐', '第 8 个课程日：餐厅点餐', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"自然表达想要","pattern":"I''d like + 名词","explanation":"I''d like 是 I would like 的缩写，比 I want 更适合点餐。","exampleEnglish":"I''d like the noodles.","exampleChinese":"我想要面条。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Could I see the menu?","chinese":"我可以看看菜单吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Of course. Here you are.","chinese":"当然，给你。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"I''d like the chicken rice.","chinese":"我想要鸡肉饭。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Good choice.","chinese":"不错的选择。"}]'::jsonb, '菜单上最熟悉的词', 'The menu has many long names, but Lin does not need to understand everything. She finds the words chicken and rice. There is a small picture beside them. She points to the dish and orders it with one clear sentence.', '菜单上有很多很长的菜名，但小林不需要全部看懂。她找到了 chicken 和 rice，旁边还有一张小图片。她指着那道菜，用一句清楚的话完成点餐。', 1)
