values ('survival-10', 10, 2, '吃饭点单', '结账也不慌', '餐厅综合复习', '第 10 个课程日：餐厅综合复习', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"用 by 表示方式","pattern":"by + 付款/交通方式","explanation":"by card 表示用卡，by train 表示乘火车。","exampleEnglish":"Can I pay by card?","exampleChinese":"我可以刷卡吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Could I have the bill, please?","chinese":"可以给我账单吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Sure. Here you are.","chinese":"当然，给你。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Can I pay by card?","chinese":"可以刷卡吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Yes. Would you like a receipt?","chinese":"可以。需要收据吗？"}]'::jsonb, '从点单到结账', 'Lin orders noodles and hot tea. She asks for food that is not too spicy. After the meal, she checks the bill and pays by card. She keeps the receipt in her bag. One complete meal uses many small sentences she already knows.', '小林点了面条和热茶，并要求不要太辣。饭后，她核对账单并刷卡付款，把收据放进包里。一顿完整的饭，用到了许多她已经会的小句子。', 1)
