values ('survival-11', 11, 3, '机场交通', '机场值机', '值机柜台', '第 11 个课程日：值机柜台', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"递交物品","pattern":"Here is my + 名词","explanation":"把证件递给工作人员时，用 Here is my。","exampleEnglish":"Here is my ticket.","exampleChinese":"这是我的票。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Staff","english":"May I see your passport?","chinese":"可以看一下你的护照吗？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Sure. Here is my passport.","chinese":"当然，这是我的护照。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Do you have any luggage?","chinese":"你有行李吗？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Yes, one bag. I''d like a window seat.","chinese":"有，一个包。我想要靠窗座位。"}]'::jsonb, '把证件放在手边', 'Lin arrives at the airport early. She keeps her passport and ticket in a small front pocket. At the check-in desk, she gives the staff her passport, checks her luggage, and asks for a window seat. Everything is easy because she prepared first.', '小林提前到达机场，把护照和机票放在前侧小口袋里。在值机柜台，她递出护照、托运行李，并请求靠窗座位。因为事先准备好了，一切都很顺利。', 1)
