values ('survival-12', 12, 3, '机场交通', '安检与登机', '寻找登机口', '第 12 个课程日：寻找登机口', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"询问地点","pattern":"Where is + 地点?","explanation":"不知道地点时直接用 Where is，后接具体位置。","exampleEnglish":"Where is security?","exampleChinese":"安检在哪里？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Excuse me, where is Gate 12?","chinese":"打扰一下，12号登机口在哪里？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Go straight and turn left.","chinese":"直走然后左转。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Is the flight boarding now?","chinese":"航班现在登机了吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Not yet. You have twenty minutes.","chinese":"还没有，你还有二十分钟。"}]'::jsonb, '找到正确的门', 'After security, Lin checks the big screen. Her flight leaves from Gate 12, but the airport is large. She asks a staff member for help and follows the signs. At the gate, she still has twenty minutes, so she sits down and checks her boarding pass.', '安检后，小林查看大屏幕。她的航班从12号登机口出发，但机场很大。她向工作人员求助并跟着指示牌走。到达登机口时还有二十分钟，她坐下来再次检查登机牌。', 1)
