values ('survival-15', 15, 3, '机场交通', '从机场到酒店', '交通综合复习', '第 15 个课程日：交通综合复习', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"离某地多远","pattern":"far from + 地点","explanation":"from 后面接出发点。","exampleEnglish":"Is the station far from the hotel?","exampleChinese":"车站离酒店远吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Is the hotel far from here?","chinese":"酒店离这里远吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"No. Go straight for two blocks.","chinese":"不远，直走两个街区。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Turn right at the bank.","chinese":"在银行右转。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Thank you. I''ll check my map.","chinese":"谢谢，我会看地图。"}]'::jsonb, '最后十分钟的路', 'Lin arrives at the station and opens her map. The hotel is near, but one street is closed. She asks a staff member for another way. She goes straight, turns right at a bank, and sees the hotel sign. The trip from the airport is finally complete.', '小林到达车站后打开地图。酒店很近，但有一条街封闭了。她向工作人员询问另一条路，直走并在银行右转，终于看到酒店招牌。从机场出发的路程完成了。', 1)
