values ('survival-16', 16, 4, '酒店住宿', '办理酒店入住', '酒店前台', '第 16 个课程日：酒店前台', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"预订在谁名下","pattern":"under + 姓名","explanation":"酒店里 under 后接预订人姓名。","exampleEnglish":"It''s under Li.","exampleChinese":"预订姓名是李。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Hi, I have a reservation.","chinese":"你好，我有预订。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"What name is it under?","chinese":"预订姓名是什么？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"It''s under Lin.","chinese":"姓名是Lin。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Great. Here is your room key.","chinese":"好的，这是你的房卡。"}]'::jsonb, '把预订单截图', 'Lin reaches the hotel in the evening. She says she has a reservation and gives her name. The staff finds the booking for three nights. Lin also keeps a screenshot on her phone, so she can show the dates quickly if there is a problem.', '小林傍晚到达酒店，说明自己有预订并报上姓名。工作人员找到了三晚的订单。小林手机里也保存了截图，出现问题时可以快速展示日期。', 1)
