values ('survival-17', 17, 4, '酒店住宿', '找到酒店设施', '房间与公共区域', '第 17 个课程日：房间与公共区域', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"某处有什么","pattern":"There is / There are","explanation":"一个事物用 There is，多个事物用 There are。","exampleEnglish":"There is a towel in the room.","exampleChinese":"房间里有一条毛巾。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"What''s the Wi-Fi password?","chinese":"无线网络密码是什么？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"It''s on your room key card.","chinese":"在你的房卡上。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"And where is the elevator?","chinese":"电梯在哪里？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"It''s next to the front desk.","chinese":"在前台旁边。"}]'::jsonb, '先认识房间', 'Lin enters her room and checks the important things first. There are two towels beside the shower. The Wi-Fi password is on the key card. Breakfast is on the second floor, and the elevator is near the front desk.', '小林进入房间后先检查重要物品。淋浴旁有两条毛巾，房卡上写着无线网络密码。早餐在二楼，电梯靠近前台。', 1)
