values ('survival-18', 18, 4, '酒店住宿', '房间有问题', '打电话给前台', '第 18 个课程日：打电话给前台', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"描述问题","pattern":"名词 + is + 形容词","explanation":"把具体物品放前面，再用形容词说明状态。","exampleEnglish":"The room is cold.","exampleChinese":"房间很冷。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Hello. The shower is broken.","chinese":"你好，淋浴坏了。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"I''m sorry to hear that.","chinese":"很抱歉。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Could someone take a look?","chinese":"可以请人来看一下吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Yes, we''ll send someone now.","chinese":"可以，我们马上派人过去。"}]'::jsonb, '清楚描述一个问题', 'The shower in Lin''s room has no hot water. She calls the front desk and says the shower is broken. She gives her room number and asks for help. A staff member comes ten minutes later and fixes it.', '小林房间的淋浴没有热水。她打电话给前台，说明淋浴坏了，报上房间号并请求帮助。十分钟后工作人员过来修好了。', 1)
