values ('survival-19', 19, 4, '酒店住宿', '请求与退房', '离开酒店', '第 19 个课程日：离开酒店', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"请求许可","pattern":"Can I + 动词?","explanation":"询问自己是否可以做某事，用 Can I。","exampleEnglish":"Can I leave my bags here?","exampleChinese":"我可以把包放在这里吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Can I check out at one?","chinese":"我可以一点退房吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Yes, late checkout is available.","chinese":"可以，能够延迟退房。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Could you keep my bags after that?","chinese":"之后可以帮我保管行李吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Of course.","chinese":"当然。"}]'::jsonb, '退房后的半天', 'Lin''s flight is in the evening, but checkout is at noon. She asks for one extra hour and leaves her bags with the hotel. She visits a nearby park without carrying heavy luggage. Later, she returns and calls a taxi.', '小林的航班在晚上，但酒店中午退房。她请求多住一小时，并把行李寄存在酒店。没有沉重行李，她轻松去了附近公园。之后她返回酒店并叫了出租车。', 1)
