values ('survival-20', 20, 4, '酒店住宿', '住酒店完整一天', '酒店综合复习', '第 20 个课程日：酒店综合复习', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"表示位置","pattern":"in / on / next to","explanation":"in 表示在里面，on 表示在某层，next to 表示紧挨着。","exampleEnglish":"The room is on the third floor.","exampleChinese":"房间在三楼。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Is breakfast still available?","chinese":"早餐现在还有吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Yes, until ten.","chinese":"有，供应到十点。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"My taxi is coming. I''ll wait in the lobby.","chinese":"出租车快到了，我会在大堂等。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Have a good trip!","chinese":"旅途愉快！"}]'::jsonb, '从入住到离开', 'Lin checks in, finds her room on the third floor, and connects to Wi-Fi. When the shower has a problem, she calls for help. The next day, she eats breakfast, checks out, and waits for her taxi in the lobby. She can now handle a full hotel stay.', '小林办理入住，找到三楼的房间并连接无线网络。淋浴出现问题时，她打电话求助。第二天，她吃完早餐、办理退房，并在大堂等出租车。现在她能独立完成一次酒店住宿。', 1)
