values ('survival-21', 21, 5, '购物求助', '询价和付款', '纪念品商店', '第 21 个课程日：纪念品商店', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"询问价格","pattern":"How much is / are ...?","explanation":"一个物品用 is，多个物品用 are。","exampleEnglish":"How much are these postcards?","exampleChinese":"这些明信片多少钱？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"How much is this cup?","chinese":"这个杯子多少钱？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"It''s twelve dollars.","chinese":"12美元。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Okay, I''ll take it.","chinese":"好的，我要了。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"You can pay over there.","chinese":"你可以在那里付款。"}]'::jsonb, '先换算再决定', 'Lin finds a handmade cup in a small shop. There is no clear price, so she asks the staff. Twelve dollars is within her budget. She checks the cup for damage, decides to take it, and pays by card.', '小林在一家小店发现一个手工杯子。上面没有清楚的价格，所以她询问店员。12美元在她的预算内。她检查杯子是否破损，决定购买并刷卡付款。', 1)
