values ('survival-23', 23, 5, '购物求助', '在药店说明不舒服', '药店', '第 23 个课程日：药店', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"描述症状","pattern":"I have + 症状","explanation":"headache、fever 前面可以直接用 I have。","exampleEnglish":"I have a fever.","exampleChinese":"我发烧了。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"I have a headache and a small fever.","chinese":"我头痛，还有一点发烧。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"How long have you felt this way?","chinese":"这样多久了？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Since this morning.","chinese":"从今天早上开始。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"You should see a doctor if it gets worse.","chinese":"如果加重，你应该去看医生。"}]'::jsonb, '把症状说具体', 'Lin wakes up with a headache and a small fever. At the pharmacy, she explains when the symptoms started. The pharmacist gives her medicine and writes down how often to take it. Lin also saves the address of a nearby doctor in case she feels worse.', '小林醒来时头痛并有点发烧。在药店，她说明症状何时开始。药剂师给她药并写下服用频率。小林还保存了附近医生的地址，以防情况加重。', 1)
