values ('survival-24', 24, 5, '购物求助', '迷路与紧急求助', '街头求助', '第 24 个课程日：街头求助', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"请求别人行动","pattern":"Please + 动词原形","explanation":"紧急情况下直接说 Please call / help / wait。","exampleEnglish":"Please help me.","exampleChinese":"请帮帮我。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Excuse me, I''m lost. Can you help me?","chinese":"打扰一下，我迷路了，可以帮我吗？"},{"speaker":"Local","english":"Of course. Where do you want to go?","chinese":"当然，你想去哪里？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"I need to get back to my hotel.","chinese":"我需要回酒店。"},{"speaker":"Local","english":"This bus will take you there.","chinese":"这辆公交会带你到那里。"}]'::jsonb, '站在安全的地方求助', 'Lin takes a wrong turn and cannot find the hotel. She moves to a bright, busy shop instead of staying on a quiet street. She shows the hotel address to the staff and asks for help. Soon she finds the correct bus and feels safe again.', '小林走错了路，找不到酒店。她没有停在安静的街道，而是走进一家明亮且人多的商店。她向店员展示酒店地址并求助，很快找到了正确的公交车，再次感到安全。', 1)
