values ('survival-25', 25, 5, '购物求助', '丢失物品怎么办', '求助综合复习', '第 25 个课程日：求助综合复习', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"表达不能","pattern":"I can''t + 动词","explanation":"can''t 后接动词原形，表示无法完成某事。","exampleEnglish":"I can''t find my passport.","exampleChinese":"我找不到护照了。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"I can''t find my wallet.","chinese":"我找不到钱包了。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Where did you last see it?","chinese":"你最后在哪里看到它？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"At the coffee shop, I think.","chinese":"我想是在咖啡店。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Let''s contact the shop first.","chinese":"我们先联系那家店。"}]'::jsonb, '先停下来回想', 'Lin cannot find her wallet. She stops, checks every pocket, and remembers using it at a coffee shop. The hotel staff calls the shop and confirms that the wallet is there. Lin takes her passport copy and goes back to collect it.', '小林找不到钱包。她停下来检查每个口袋，想起最后在咖啡店用过。酒店员工致电店里，确认钱包在那里。小林带上护照复印件返回领取。', 1)
