values ('survival-26', 26, 6, '独立旅行', '天气改变计划', '安排一天行程', '第 26 个课程日：安排一天行程', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"谈论天气","pattern":"It is + 天气形容词","explanation":"天气通常用 It is 开头。","exampleEnglish":"It is rainy today.","exampleChinese":"今天下雨。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Anna","english":"It''s rainy today.","chinese":"今天下雨。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Let''s change the plan.","chinese":"我们改一下计划吧。"},{"speaker":"Anna","english":"How about the art museum?","chinese":"去美术馆怎么样？"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Great idea. We can visit the park tomorrow.","chinese":"好主意，我们明天可以去公园。"}]'::jsonb, '雨天也有好行程', 'Lin plans to walk in the park, but the morning is rainy and cloudy. She does not let the weather ruin the day. She moves the park trip to tomorrow and visits an art museum instead. In the evening, the rain stops and the streets shine.', '小林原计划去公园散步，但早上阴雨绵绵。她没有让天气毁掉一天，而是把公园行程改到明天，转去参观美术馆。傍晚雨停了，街道闪闪发亮。', 1)
