values ('survival-27', 27, 6, '独立旅行', '请别人帮忙拍照', '景点交流', '第 27 个课程日：景点交流', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"为某人做某事","pattern":"动词 + for + 人","explanation":"take a photo for us 表示为我们拍照。","exampleEnglish":"Could you write it for me?","exampleChinese":"你可以帮我写下来吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Excuse me, could you take a photo for us?","chinese":"打扰一下，可以帮我们拍张照吗？"},{"speaker":"Traveler","english":"Sure. Stand together by the tree.","chinese":"可以，站到树旁边。"},{"speaker":"Traveler","english":"Smile!","chinese":"笑一个！"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Thank you. One more, please.","chinese":"谢谢，请再来一张。"}]'::jsonb, '照片之外的小交流', 'The garden is beautiful, and Lin wants a photo with Anna. She politely asks another traveler for help and shows how to use the camera. After the photo, they talk about the garden for a minute. A simple request becomes a friendly travel memory.', '花园很美，小林想和安娜合影。她礼貌地请另一位游客帮忙，并展示相机如何使用。拍完后，她们聊了一会儿花园。一个简单请求变成了友好的旅行记忆。', 1)
