values ('survival-28', 28, 6, '独立旅行', '订票与确认', '博物馆预约', '第 28 个课程日：博物馆预约', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"表达数量","pattern":"数字 + 可数名词复数","explanation":"数量大于一时，可数名词通常加 s。","exampleEnglish":"I''d like two tickets.","exampleChinese":"我想要两张票。"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"I''d like to book two tickets for tomorrow.","chinese":"我想预订两张明天的票。"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Ten o''clock is available.","chinese":"十点有票。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Great. Could you confirm the address?","chinese":"好的，可以确认地址吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"I''ll send it by email.","chinese":"我会通过邮件发送。"}]'::jsonb, '把预约信息放在一起', 'Lin books two museum tickets for ten o''clock. She receives an email with the address and a QR code. Before bed, she confirms the date, time, and route. In the morning, she only needs to open one saved message.', '小林预订了两张十点的博物馆门票，收到包含地址和二维码的邮件。睡前，她确认日期、时间和路线。第二天早上，只需打开一条保存好的消息。', 1)
