values ('survival-29', 29, 6, '独立旅行', '返程与行李', '车站和机场', '第 29 个课程日：车站和机场', 6, 'published', timezone('utc', now()), '{"title":"一般疑问句","pattern":"Is + 名词 + 形容词?","explanation":"把 is 放到前面，就能询问某个状态是否成立。","exampleEnglish":"Is the flight delayed?","exampleChinese":"航班延误了吗？"}'::jsonb, '[{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Is the train delayed?","chinese":"火车晚点了吗？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Yes, by fifteen minutes.","chinese":"是的，晚点十五分钟。"},{"speaker":"Lin","english":"Which platform should I use?","chinese":"我应该去哪个站台？"},{"speaker":"Staff","english":"Platform six.","chinese":"6号站台。"}]'::jsonb, '给延误留一点空间', 'On the return day, Lin leaves the hotel early. Her train is delayed by fifteen minutes, but she has enough time. She checks the platform, keeps her baggage beside her, and watches the departure screen. At the airport, she finds her gate without rushing.', '返程当天，小林提前离开酒店。火车晚点十五分钟，但她预留了足够时间。她确认站台，把行李放在身边，并查看出发屏幕。到机场后，她从容地找到了登机口。', 1)
